# The 0.2.0 packs (scripts/pack-emu.sh): what each pack's mix of mods shows. LFO 1's WAVE from SINE up 16 to KEY
# and one more (it holds); the ARP menu's MODE up to TM; then the three SEND FX pages (the delay slot, the reverb
# slot, the chorus slot): Elektron's names where the slot is Elektron's, ours where it is ours. Run with t63b_live.
wait-emu 0.5
png 00-main
tap semicolon        # MOD: LFO 1
wait-emu 0.5
down space
wait-emu 0.1
tap percent          # FUNC + E left: WAVE to its default (SINE)
wait-emu 0.2
up space
